ress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04a92f4188191fb1812b780aa6ee5758 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d60ec17d05ad2a19c61a33185ebd8d84", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d60ec17d05ad2a19c61a33185ebd8d84, https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e1cb5f2d50838cf6bc58f8420da80540 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f88fd50e/uploads/origins/870461ea-47b8-4cb9-aa56-5e6890266b81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23929d96300873df799974b8b6ae92fe 3x"}, "body": "Dear \ud83d\udd2a, nice to meet you.\n\nI saw your illustration and fell in love at first sight with your cute, yet somehow disturbing and captivating style. I would love to have you draw an illustration of Rei Kuroma (@kuromareiriam), who is a V-lover.\n\nWhat do you want to use the illustration for?\nAs a gift to the person in question and for personal viewing\nThe illustration may be used only by the person himself/herself for distribution activities (in distribution, as a thumbnail of distribution, as a return gift to listeners, on X (formerly Twitter), etc.).\n*Rei Kuroma has permission to make requests on Skeb and other sites.\n\n \u25efReference materials\n Please refer to the URL page of the reference materials for standing drawings and other materials.\n\nSituations, etc.\nI like your sense of style, so I would be happy if you could draw in your own way in your area of expertise without losing the style of your drawing.\n\nFormat\nPSD or PNG data is preferred.\nWe would like to receive data with the illustration and background layered.\n\nOther\nWe would appreciate it if you could make it so that the ears and hair are not visible so that we can easily use them as thumbnails, etc.\nWe would be happy if you have a background as well. (It is okay if you don't have any background.)\nIf there are any missing amounts, please send us a resend request.\n\n(As a side note, I like the following illustrations by \ud83d\udd2a very much...!)\n\n\nhttps://x.com/apjjsfmd/status/1855472348641821120?s=46&t=7hNaxooGP7xkeuikF_oT3g\n\nhttps://x.com/apjjsfmd/status/1592858932070223875?s=46&t=7hNaxooGP7xkeuikF_oT3g\n\n\nWe sincerely appreciate your consideration of this matter.\nWe sincerely support \ud83d\udd2as activities in the future.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1--Nukg4A_SLDP0LjT-1pz4lFRpdLVSZ2", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@apjjsfmd/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1802887, "client_id": 2798522, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d79f4bdaecefa9e7d5dc6fa703e37210", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d79f4bdaecefa9e7d5dc6fa703e37210, https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0c5e6afc477ebab84eafd280316d9d8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7117766d/uploads/origins/67aa5d35-0c45-4483-9c27-a14291309f25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=419252152d4f73f76d58938156b31da6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": fa